Ants, or Giant Ants, are not your average garden fare insects. They can spit acid, which both ignores and damages your armor. They are only found guarding [[Ant Hill|Ant Hills]] and inside [[Ant Hill Dungeon|Ant Hill Dungeons.]] Each ant hill generally has 2 to 5 ant swarms, but can very rarely have up to 12. When raiding an ant hill, all the ants guarding it will attack. Because of their low hitpoints and base damage, Ants are the best creature to fight to learn the combat system.

==Combat==

Taking any amount of damage from Ants can result in [[Wounds|Antcid Burns]].

===Behaviour===

Passive until you aggro them. Aggroing Ants will not aggro nearby Ants or Ants of other [[Ant Hill]]s.

Raiding an [[Ant Hill]] causes all nearby ants to attack. If you kill all Ants of an [[Ant Hill]] and begin to Raid it, the Ants that respawn during the time that you are raiding the hill will not aggro onto you.

